00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.450
I mean TLS everywhere.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.840
So that's the first
session that is established

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.180
between the client and the VIP.

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:50.910
Then I have also added
here-- have configured--

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:54.880
a feature that is available
as beta, which is the Google

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.040
managed certs.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.040
So we are going to take
